{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Metro City, 1999. Leather-jacket-wearing, chain-smoking, no-nonsense detective Jason Maxx is on the case, danger lurking behind every corner like a surprise birthday party of crime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745110/extras/2a014e86c3ea25be0ea3632efa22f35e.poster.avif?t=1751638982\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745110/extras/2a014e86c3ea25be0ea3632efa22f35e.webp?t=1751638982\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Things, however, might get a little goofy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Metro City is an absurd place full of goofballs, miscreants, dirtbags and <strong>the occasional murderous maniac</strong>, plus plenty of sight gags and low poly, retro 3D graphics. <strong>Sarcastic quips, visual humor and low-res textures abound!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745110/extras/da47dac8be7398940b84f054364cb07f.avif?t=1751638982\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get the clues, meet some weirdos and solve the case!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745110/extras/630f9b48e5e491ac838eb959e591a645.avif?t=1751638982\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve the mystery through a series of conversations, interrogations and combing of clues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the dark eerie Metro City</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2-3 hour playthrough</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dark humor aplenty!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745110/extras/Jason_Maxx_CD_Themed_Banner.png?t=1751638982\" /></div></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3745110?t=1751638982","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745110/701c03455c57bd7d594d99212a129d6ed14d2498/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751638982","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745110/f1fdb5bc1359c17dad519a1068ec25664bbf8626/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751638982","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745110/f1fdb5bc1359c17dad519a1068ec25664bbf8626/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751638982","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"Sex & Nudity: Mild\r\n\r\nVery brief sex-related jokes.\r\n\r\nViolence & Gore: Moderate\r\n\r\nSome blood, shooting and police-related action. A corpse is seen, with no graphic gore.\r\n\r\nProfanity: Severe\r\n\r\nSeveral uses of the words \u201cb!tch\u201d, \u201cd@mn\u201d, \u201csh!t\u201d, \u201c@ss\u201d, \u201cpu$$y\u201d. Few but multiple uses of the word \u201cf#ck\u201d.\r\n\r\nAlcohol, Drugs & Smoking: Moderate\r\n\r\nSome characters smoke and purchase cigarettes. There are several tongue-in-cheek comments about cigarette, alcohol and drug use.\r\n\r\nFrightening & Intense Content: Moderate\r\n\r\nThere\u2019s very dark humor throughout. There are jokes about suicide, murder, organized crime, mental health, death of family members, violence towards children, violence towards animals, evil corporations, gun use, police corruption and prostitution. A corpse is seen. The tone of the game is dark and atmospheric, but the dialogue is often very comedic and the characters often behave in silly ways. The game is rather self-aware and satirical; it doesn\u2019t wallow in the darkness."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Metro City, 1999. Leather-jacket-wearing, chain-smoking, no-nonsense detective Jason Maxx is on the case, danger lurking behind every corner like a surprise birthday party of crime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745110/extras/2a014e86c3ea25be0ea3632efa22f35e.poster.avif?t=1751638982\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745110/extras/2a014e86c3ea25be0ea3632efa22f35e.webp?t=1751638982\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Things, however, might get a little goofy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Metro City is an absurd place full of goofballs, miscreants, dirtbags and <strong>the occasional murderous maniac</strong>, plus plenty of sight gags and low poly, retro 3D graphics. <strong>Sarcastic quips, visual humor and low-res textures abound!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745110/extras/da47dac8be7398940b84f054364cb07f.avif?t=1751638982\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get the clues, meet some weirdos and solve the case!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745110/extras/630f9b48e5e491ac838eb959e591a645.avif?t=1751638982\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve the mystery through a series of conversations, interrogations and combing of clues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the dark eerie Metro City</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2-3 hour playthrough</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dark humor aplenty!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745110/extras/Jason_Maxx_CD_Themed_Banner.png?t=1751638982\" /></div></p></li></ul>","developers":["Nabos Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745110/d22f827ec744d82acbca315a791712495c3a8437/header.jpg?t=1751638982","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257155757,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257155757/movie480.mp4?t=1749697189","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257155757/movie_max.mp4?t=1749697189"},"name":"Announcement","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257155757/42e6a2b1ef7e89826488480c9d8ef87b284c4f59/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749697189","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257155757/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749697189","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257155757/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1749697189"}}],"name":"Jason Maxx","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 8<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><l